    "text": "Leofan men, us is deope beboden \u00fe\u00e6t we geornlice mynegian & l\u00e6ran sculan \u00fe\u00e6t manna gehwylc to\nSe cwyde is swy\u00f0e egeslic \u00fee God \u00feurh \u00feone witegan be \u00feam cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fee Godes folce bodian sculon, \u00fe\u00e6t\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 be \u00feam: Clama, ne cesses; quasi tuba exalta uocem tuam, et reliqua.\nClypa hlude & ahefe up \u00f0ine stemne & gecy\u00f0 minum folce \u00fe\u00e6t hit georne fram synnum gecyrre.\nGyf \u00f0u \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t ne dest ac forsuwast hit & nelt folce his \u00feearfe gecy\u00f0an, \u00feonne scealt \u00feu ealra \u00fe\u00e6ra\n\u00d0es cwyde m\u00e6g beon swy\u00f0e gemyndiglic eallum \u00feam \u00fee to \u00feam gesette syn, \u00fe\u00e6t hi Godes folce riht\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0, se witega, \u00e6fter \u00feam: Gyf \u00f0u Godes folce riht bodast & \u00f0u hit gebigean ne miht to rihte,\nLeofan men, ic bidde eow \u00fe\u00e6t ge ge\u00feyldelice hlystan \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e ic eow nu secgan wille.\nHit is lang to areccenne \u00fe\u00e6t we on bocum ymbe Godes wundra r\u00e6da\u00f0.\nNu wille ic \u00feeah be suman d\u00e6le scortlice hit eow sum asecgan.\nAn is ece God \u00fee gesceop heofonas & eor\u00f0an & ealle gesceafta, & on fruman he gelogode on \u00fe\u00e6re\n\u00d0a wear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6r an \u00fe\u00e6ra engla swa scinende & swa beorht & swa wlitig \u00fe\u00e6t se w\u00e6s Lucifer genemned.\n\u00dea \u00feuhte him \u00fe\u00e6t he mihte beon \u00fe\u00e6s efengelica \u00f0e hine gescop & geworhte; and sona swa he \u00feurh\n\u00c6fter \u00feam gescop God \u00e6lmihtig \u00e6nne man of eor\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Adam, & of Adames anum ribbe he\nAnd to \u00f0am hy gesceop God \u00e6lmihtig, \u00fe\u00e6t hy & heora ofspring scoldan gefyllan & gem\u00e6nigfyldan \u00fe\u00e6t\nAc sona swa deofol ongeat \u00fe\u00e6t mann to \u00f0am gescapen w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t he scolde & his cynn gefyllan on\nGod lyfde Adame \u00fe\u00e6t he moste brucan ealra w\u00e6stma, butan anes treowes w\u00e6stm he him forbead \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dea beswac deofol & forl\u00e6rde his wif \u00e6rest & heo hine sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t hy abr\u00e6can Godes bebod & \u00e6tan of\nAnd sona swa \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t hi swa gedon h\u00e6fdon, \u00fea h\u00e6fdon hy forworhte hy sylfe & wurdon of \u00fe\u00e6re\n& of heom twam is eall manncynn cumen.\nHeora bearna an gedyde sy\u00f0\u00f0an eac \u00feurh deofles lare deoflice d\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Cain.\nHe ofsloh Abel, his agenne bro\u00f0or, & \u00f0a w\u00e6s Godes yrre \u00feurh \u00f0a d\u00e6de ofer eor\u00f0an yfele geniwod.\nAnd sy\u00f0\u00f0an aa swa heora ofspringes & mancynnes mare wear\u00f0, swa deofol ma and ma manna forl\u00e6rde\n\u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t an scyp \u00fee Godd sylf gedihte Noe to wyrcanne, & on \u00f0am anum scype wear\u00f0 genered se\nEall \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fre mancynnes elles w\u00e6s, eall hit adranc, & eall \u00fe\u00e6t nu is, eall hit com of \u00f0am mannum \u00fee on\nAnd \u00f0a sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t se flod gesette & Noe & his suna landes geweald ahtan, hy gestryndan fela\n\u00d0a dyde deofol \u00fea gyt, ealswa he a de\u00f0, mannum mycle dare.\nHe gedwealde eft m\u00e6nigne man to \u00feam swy\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t hy ofergeaton & forgymdon \u00e6t nyhstan heora\nSwa hy dwelode deofol & adwealde.\nHw\u00e6t, \u00fea yrmingas nyston na hu lytelice hy \u00feonne deofol bep\u00e6hte, \u00fee ma \u00fee \u00fea witan \u00fee gyt on \u00fea\nDeofol ah \u00feurh Godes ge\u00feafunge \u00fe\u00e6s geweald \u00fe\u00e6t he mot manna fandian hw\u00e6\u00f0er heora ge\u00feanc aht sy,\n\u00c6lc yfel cym\u00f0 of deofle & \u00e6lc broc & nan bot.\n\u00deonne de\u00fe he \u00feeah swy\u00f0e lytelice \u00fe\u00e6r he ongyt unw\u00e6re menn, sent sona on hy sylfe, o\u00f0\u00f0on hwilum on\nLa, for hwy \u00feonne bi\u00f0 hit swa, buton for\u00f0am \u00fee se mann by\u00f0 \u00feonne beswicen & deofol ah \u00f0a saule\nOf deofle ne cym\u00f0 \u00e6nig o\u00feer bot buton \u00feonne he h\u00e6f\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s mannes sawle beswicen, \u00feonne geswic\u00f0 he\nLeofan men, \u00fea \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t deofol folc swa mistlice dwelede, swa ic eow \u00e6r rehte, \u00fea w\u00e6s \u00feeah an\n& of \u00f0\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e com se m\u00e6ra mann Abraham \u00fee man on bocum fela ymbe r\u00e6de\u00fe.\nAnd of \u00f0am m\u00e6ran Abrahame comon heahf\u00e6deras, and of his m\u00e6ran cynne eac coman \u00fea witegan \u00fee\nSe Moyses w\u00e6s Godes sylfes gespeca, and se Moyses w\u00e6s eac \u00fe\u00e6s rihtcynnes.\nAnd of \u00f0am sylfum Abrahames cynne com eft Iudea cynecynn.\nAnd \u00f0\u00e6ra cyninga sum hatte Dauid, \u00fee of \u00f0am cynne asprang, se wear\u00f0 swy\u00f0e m\u00e6re man \u00e6g\u00f0er ge\nAnd swa\u00feeah hw\u00e6\u00f0ere sume \u00fea \u00f0e his cynnes w\u00e6ron & \u00e6fter him \u00f0\u00e6s rices weoldon mishyrdan Gode\nSume hy wurdon \u00e6t nyhstan swa \u00feurh deofol ahyrde \u00fe\u00e6t hi n\u00e6fdon to Gode na\u00f0er ne lufe ne ege swa\nAnd \u00e6t nyhstan \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00f0a wear\u00f0 swa wi\u00f0 God forworht \u00fe\u00e6t he let faran h\u00e6\u00feenne here & forhergian\n& \u00f0one cyningc Sedechiam \u00fee \u00fea w\u00e6s on Iudea lande man geband, & ealle \u00fea dugu\u00f0e \u00fee on \u00feam\nAc eft \u00e6fter \u00feam ymbe lxx geara \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e seo hergung w\u00e6s, Cyrus hatte Persa cyning.\nSe gefreode, ealswa God wolde, eal \u00fe\u00e6t Iudeisce folc \u00fee \u00fea on life w\u00e6s & let hy faran ham to heora\nAnd \u00fea \u00f0a \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t Crist geboren wear\u00f0, \u00fea w\u00e6s agan geargerimes fram \u00feam timan \u00fee Adam\nNu is m\u00e6nig ungel\u00e6red man \u00fee wile \u00feencan hu \u00fe\u00e6t beon m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t se \u00f0e gescop on fruman ealle\nAc ic wylle eow gyt cu\u00f0licor secgan, \u00fe\u00e6t ge hit magon \u00fee swutelicor ongytan.\nHe w\u00e6s \u00e6fre so\u00f0 Godd & is & aa bi\u00f0, & he gescop \u00feurh his godcundan mihte ealle gesceafta lange \u00e6r\nSeo menniscnes is wundorlic ymbe to smeagenne.\nFull mycel wundor hit w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den geb\u00e6r cild \u00fee n\u00e6fre naht \u00feurh h\u00e6med\u00feing weres\n\u00c6r he w\u00e6s so\u00f0 Godd on godcundnesse & n\u00e6s na mann, ac nu he is \u00e6g\u00f0er ge so\u00f0 Godd ge so\u00f0 mann.\nAnd nis \u00e6fre \u00e6niges mannes m\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fea godcundnesse asmeagan cunne; ac us is \u00feeah mycel \u00feearf\nHe w\u00e6s \u00e6fre efenmihtig & he gyt is, & he a swa by\u00f0 buton \u00e6lcum ende.\nLa, hu mihte God \u00e6lmihtig wi\u00f0 manncynn mildra gewur\u00f0an \u00feonne he w\u00e6s \u00fea \u00fea he asende his agen\n\u00c6r \u00f0am timan n\u00e6s \u00e6fre \u00e6nig mann on worulde swa m\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t he on an ne sceolde to helle swa he\nAc wundorlice swy\u00f0e geeadmedde Crist hine sylfne \u00fea he for ure neode menniscnesse underfeng, &\n\u00d0a he cild w\u00e6s, eall hine man fedde swa man o\u00f0re cild fede\u00f0.\nHe l\u00e6g on cradole bewunden ealswa o\u00f0re cild do\u00f0; hine man b\u00e6r o\u00f0 he sylf gan mihte.\n\u00d0urh \u00e6lc \u00feing seo menniscnes adreah \u00fe\u00e6t hyre to gebyrede.\nHine \u00feyrste hwylum & hwilum hingrode.\nHe \u00e6t & dranc, & \u00e6g\u00f0er he \u00feolode ge cyle ge h\u00e6tan.\nEall seo menniscnes \u00feolode \u00fe\u00e6t menn to gebyrede, for\u00f0am \u00fee he w\u00e6s so\u00f0 man \u00feurh his\nAnd he \u00feeah, swa hit m\u00e6\u00f0 w\u00e6s, f\u00e6gere for\u00f0werd, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hit com to \u00f0am \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6re ylde w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00f0urh m\u00e6nige wundra \u00fee he worhte he eac geswutelode \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s & is so\u00f0lice Godes sunu.\nAnd sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6fter \u00feam \u00fea se tima com \u00fe\u00e6t he for eall manncynn \u00ferowian wolde, \u00fea s\u00e6de he his\nIudeisc folc \u00feurh deofles lare hine forr\u00e6dde, & an his agenra cnihta hine bel\u00e6wde to dea\u00fee.\nHit w\u00e6s \u00f0eah eall geworden for ure neode, swa he sylf wolde, & \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s swutol \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0riddan d\u00e6ges,\nAc he alysde us \u00feurh his dea\u00f0 of ecan dea\u00f0e & geswutelode mid his \u00e6riste \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6f\u00f0 us gerymed\nHit gewear\u00f0 ymbe xl daga \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he of dea\u00f0e aras \u00fe\u00e6t him com of heofonum ongean mycel engla\n\u00d0onne is us mycel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we eac \u00fe\u00e6t understandan \u00fe\u00e6t hit to \u00f0am dome nu georne neal\u00e6c\u00f0 \u00fee he\nAnd, gelyfe se \u00fee wille, we witan to so\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fe\u00e6rto georne neal\u00e6c\u00f0, for\u00f0am \u00fee we habba\u00f0\nHe s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fter \u00feisum f\u00e6ce gewur\u00f0an sceall swa egeslic tima swa \u00e6fre \u00e6r n\u00e6s sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00feeos woruld\nAntecristes tima bi\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00f0ysum, & nu swy\u00f0e ra\u00f0e his man m\u00e6g wenan, & \u00f0urh hine gewyr\u00f0 swa\nEall middaneard bi\u00f0 \u00feurh hine gedreht & gedrefed, & eal hit forwurde gyf God his hwile ne scyrte.\nAc Godd hine forde\u00fe \u00fee ra\u00feor, for\u00f0am \u00fee he wile gebeorhgan \u00feam \u00f0e him sylfum syn gecorene &\nAnd ra\u00f0e sy\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6fter \u00feam, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e us bec secga\u00fe, gewyr\u00f0 se micla dom, & \u00f0eos woruld geenda\u00f0.\nOn \u00feam dome witodlice sceal manna gehwylc habban swylc edlean swylc he on life \u00e6r geearnode: &\nEala, leofan men, utan we don swa us mycel \u00feearf is, lufian Godd eallum mode & eallum m\u00e6gene &",
